            "page_number": 4,
            "links": []
        },
        "text": "Example: In a performance audit assessing an agency\u2019s acquisition practices, auditors may examine whether the agency\u2019s decisions regarding purchasing, leasing, or reimbursing employees for the costs of acquiring various supplies or equipment achieved the lowest cost while meeting applicable requirements."
    },
    {
        "type": "NarrativeText",
        "element_id": "a52482c1f5da0709cf17d08aaf3594f4",
        "metadata": {
            "coordinates": {
                "points": [
                    [
                        216.0,
