            "parent_id": "cbfa75893f5d570acffb728e22430c72",
            "page_number": 4,
            "links": []
        },
        "text": "Example: In a performance audit assessing an office\u2019s policies and procedures for purchase cards, auditors\u2019 testing of the program\u2019s controls to identify deficiencies may identify fraud, waste, or abuse in its administration."
    },
    {
        "type": "NarrativeText",
